<title>USA: PP&amp;L Susquehanna 1 nuke to restart Sunday.</title>
<headline>PP&amp;L Susquehanna 1 nuke to restart Sunday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennsylvania Power &amp; Light Co's Susquehanna nuclear power unit 1 should restart operations Sunday from a scheduled maintenance and refueling which began September 7, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>The 1,090 megawatt Berwick, Pa. unit should restart near midday on Sunday, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>The Susquehanna plant is jointly owned by PP&amp;L and Allegheny Electric Cooperative Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Power Desk 212-859-1627</p>
</text>
